    {
      "text": "A forest plot of risk ratios (TBST vs TST) for pain, from four C-Tb studies (pooled RR 1.05) and one C-TST study with no events (Li 2016b). The overall random-effects pooled risk ratio is 1.05 (0.88–1.25).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
